<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>inputs/extensions.md</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Georgia, serif; max-width: 42em;
       margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; line-height: 1.5; }
code { font-family: Menlo, Monaco, monospace; font-size: 0.92em;
       background: #f2f2f2; padding: 0 0.15em; }
pre { background: #f6f6f6; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 0.8em;
      overflow-x: auto; }
pre code { background: none; padding: 0; }
blockquote { border-left: 3px solid #9c9; margin-left: 0;
             padding-left: 1em; color: #444; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; }
th, td { border: 1px solid #bbb; padding: 0.25em 0.6em; }
th { background: #eee; }
.math { white-space: nowrap; }
.math.display { display: block; text-align: center; margin: 1em 0;
                white-space: normal; }
hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #bbb; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Extensions</h1>
<p>Corpus for Phase 1 markdown constructs added after the initial pipeline. Accumulates across tasks — add new sections, don't replace old ones.</p>
<h2>Task lists (T1.1)</h2>
<ul>
<li><input type="checkbox" disabled> unchecked item</li>
<li><input type="checkbox" disabled checked> checked item (lowercase x)</li>
<li><input type="checkbox" disabled checked> checked item (uppercase X)</li>
<li>plain bullet item, no checkbox</li>
</ul>
<ol>
<li><input type="checkbox" disabled> first ordered task</li>
<li><input type="checkbox" disabled checked> second ordered task, done</li>
<li>plain ordered item</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li><input type="checkbox" disabled checked> checked item with continuation second line of the same item, indented under the checkbox</li>
</ul>
<h2>Strikethrough (T1.1)</h2>
<p>This is <del>deleted text</del> inside a sentence.</p>
<p><del>Whole line struck through.</del></p>
<p>Mixed <strong>bold and <del>struck</del> together</strong>.</p>
<h2>Reference links, titles, images (T1.2)</h2>
<p>Inline link with title: <a href="https://www.anthropic.com" title="Anthropic home">Anthropic</a>.</p>
<p>Reference link: <a href="https://example.com/docs" title="Example Docs">the docs</a> explain more.</p>
<p>Collapsed reference: <a href="https://example.com/docs-ref">Docs Ref</a> also works.</p>
<p>Shortcut reference: <a href="https://example.com/docs-ref">Docs Ref</a> resolves the same way.</p>
<p>Undefined reference stays literal: [nowhere][missing-ref].</p>
<p>Undefined shortcut stays literal: [Also Missing].</p>
<p>Image with title: <img src="https://example.com/logo.png" alt="a small logo" title="Logo title"></p>
<p>Reference image: <img src="https://example.com/image.png" alt="alt text" title="An image"></p>
<p>Paren url survives inline: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haskell_(programming_language)">Haskell</a> stays whole.</p>
<p>Paren url by reference: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haskell_(programming_language)">the Haskell article</a>.</p>
<p>Paren-form title: <a href="https://example.com/pt" title="Paren Title">point here</a> uses (title) syntax.</p>
<h2>Math small fixes (T1.5)</h2>
<p>Cube root: <span class="math">∛(8)</span>. Fourth root: <span class="math">∜(16)</span>. Other index: <span class="math">[5]√(32)</span>.</p>
<p>Plain root unaffected: <span class="math">√2</span>.</p>
<p>Nested content under a cube root: <span class="math">∛(x+y)</span>.</p>
<h2>Tables (writer coverage)</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>Tool</th><th style="text-align:center">Year</th><th style="text-align:right">Notes</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><code>mhs</code></td><td style="text-align:center">2023</td><td style="text-align:right">MicroHs <strong>compiler</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>groff</td><td style="text-align:center">1990</td><td style="text-align:right"><em>roff</em> successor</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</body>
</html>
